<section class="section" id="limits">
  <p class="eyebrow">What it is not</p>
  <h2 class="section-title">Spectra asks for a check. It does not diagnose.</h2>
  <ul class="limits">
    <li>It does not diagnose disease. A deviation score is not a probability of illness.</li>
    <li>It does not measure glucose or cuffless blood pressure.</li>
    <li>It does not recommend treatment. Clinical guidance belongs to protocols reviewed by professionals.</li>
    <li>The demo uses synthetic data. It shows that the system works technically, not how it performs clinically.</li>
  </ul>
</section>
